'''Arboliva's Forest''' (Japanese: '''オリーヴァの森''' ''Oliva's Forest'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Paldea]] [[region]], located near [[Artazon]].

In ''[[HZ011|Arboliva's Forest]]'', {{an|Nemona}} guided [[Liko]], [[Roy]], and [[Mollie]] to Arboliva's Forest, to find a {{pkmn2|giant}} {{TP|Lucius|Arboliva}}, who might have a connection with the [[Black Rayquaza]]. When they arrived they were met with half of the forest burned down from a wildfire, Roy unexpectedly climbed on Arboliva and discovered that it had the same [[Ancient Poké Ball]] attached to it.   

In ''[[HZ012|The Future I Choose]]'', wanting to help restore the forest, Liko and Roy cleaned up the forest and planted various {{Berries}} while [[Ludlow]] used his {{p|Quagsire}}'s {{m|Rain Dance}} to help the Berries grow. After restoring the forest, Arboliva returned back into its Ancient Poké Ball, having no need to protect the forest anymore.

